export anchor DarkMemphisStyle:
    number: 280
    screen: CloudFiles
    name: Dark Memphis
    idea: Memphis squiggles, confetti and dot grids on black, chunky white outlined blocks thrown slightly off grid with hard colour offset shadows, and every nav item wearing its own geometric shape.
    base: dark
    palette:
        black: #0d0d0f, the page with a dot grid, fields, status chips and text on colour
        block: #17171b, outlined blocks and the style sheet
        white: #ffffff, text, 2px outlines and the current nav
        muted: #c4c4cc, meta and labels
        pink: #ff5c93, the primary button, the PDF tile and the details shadow
        teal: #2ee0cf, the list shadow, the image tile, Shared and storage stripes
        yellow: #ffd60a, the selected row with black text, the pressed switch, folders, Starred and focus
        lilac: #b99bff, the sidebar shadow and the document tile
        orange: #ff8a3d, the video tile and Uploading
    type:
        Headings and figures in Arial Black. The folder title is 50px, the
        details heading 22px, the small kicker 13px caps tracked 0.2em in
        teal. Body in Verdana, Geneva, DejaVu Sans at 14px, file names 15px
        bold.
    layout:
        A black page with a fine dot grid and scattered confetti, a pink
        squiggle, a teal triangle, a yellow ring, a lilac square and dots,
        clipped by the section. The grid has a header over two columns
        and a details column on the right that spans both rows. The header
        has Brightwork Drive, the title Website redesign, a yellow squiggle
        underline and a breadcrumb with pink diamonds. The sidebar block
        has a lilac offset shadow and lists the five links, each led by a
        pure shape, a pink circle, a teal triangle, a yellow square, a
        lilac cross and an orange ring, the current item white with black
        text. Storage follows below a dashed rule as 64.2 GB of 100 GB used
        and a striped teal bar. The list block has a teal offset shadow, a
        toolbar with a pill search, Upload, New folder and a List or Grid
        switch with List yellow, then eight rows of a shape tile in a type
        colour, name and kind, size, and date and person with statuses.
        The selected row is solid yellow with black text. The details
        block is tilted about one degree, has a pink offset shadow and a
        white zigzag edge on top, and holds the preview, name, Starred,
        facts and the three buttons. Below 1080px details drop under the
        list. Below 720px everything stacks.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 28px between blocks, 14px block padding, 12px rows.
    density: Medium. Rows are plain and the blocks around them are loud.
    corners: Mixed on purpose. Square blocks and buttons, a pill search, file tiles cut as squares, circles, domes and leaves.
    borders: 2px white outlines on every block, tile and control, a zigzag edge on the details block.
    shadows: Hard offset colour blocks of 6 to 8px in lilac, teal and pink. Buttons get a 4px offset.
    icons:
        2.2px line icons inside filled shape tiles. Nav uses pure shapes.
        Status chips differ in outline too, a square chip with a star for
        Starred, a pill with two heads for Shared, a dashed chip with an up
        arrow for Uploading and a white chip with a checked box for
        Selected.
    focus: A 3px yellow outline offset 4px.
    tone: Loud and short, such as Upload, New folder and Details.
